{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ist aber auch schon wieder 'ne
kleine Weile her{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Du scheinst viel zu tun zu haben,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}dass du hier jetzt erst vorbeijoggst!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Meine Tür steht dir immer offen...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Oh! ¡Eh, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Te acuerdas de mí?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Soy yo, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Me mudé al pueblo cuando me lo
recomendó {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}. No paraba
de decirme que era la caña.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ya hace tiempo de aquello{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Oye, pues no te he visto por aquí
a menudo. Puedes pasarte cuando
quieras a verme, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Thanks for dropping by!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}When I was here camping,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} invited me to live here,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
so I decided to make the move!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}I know we have some catching up to
do, but I'm sick right now. Sorry!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}I think I got sick from moving so
soon after getting back from my
camping trip{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I overdid it.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm so sorry, but please come back
after I get better! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:001E:}}Aaa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}chooo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey ho, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Danke, dass du hier vorbeijoggst!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} hatte mir vorgeschlagen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
nach {{TAG:0005:0006:}} zu ziehen. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Mir hat
die Idee gefallen. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Jetzt bin ich hier!
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Ich würd ja echt gern weiter mit dir
rumhängen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}aber ich hab mir 'ne
fiese Erkältung eingefangen...
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tut mir leid! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}Komm doch wieder,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
wenn ich fit bin! {{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:001E:}}Haaaa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}tschiiii!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh! Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I forgot you live in this town!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you surprised that I decided
to move here out of the blue?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}There was actually somebody who
invited me to live here.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}But apparently that person doesn't
live here anymore.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0029:}}What a bummer! I guess I took too
long to get here.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Oh well. This is a nice place to live,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
so I might as well enjoy it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hope we can be good friends!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
